":{\"firstName\":\"Ollie\",\"lastName\":\"Robinson\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-08-29T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"16219\",\"name\":\"Walt Disney\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"very strong language, strong sex references, threat, drug misuse\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"15\"},\"localRatings\":[]}],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"The Roses\",\"synopsis\":\"Life seems easy for picture-perfect couple Ivy (Olivia Colman) and Theo (Benedict Cumberbatch): successful careers, a loving marriage, great kids. But beneath the façade of their supposed ideal life, a storm is brewing – as Theo’s career nosedives while Ivy’s own ambitions take off, a tinderbox of fierce competition and hidden resentment ignites. The Roses is a reimagining of the 1989 classic film The War of the Roses, based on the novel by Warren Adler.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/359558_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/359558_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/01/96/01965bac639b90f70a09427f2e74e9bf.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/bb10574632db65a5840160e30e2841f4.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/28eb8db0be95a1aa0a5b51dc5fd71556.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Life seems easy for picture-perfect couple Ivy (Olivia Colman) and Theo (Benedict Cumberbatch): successful careers, a loving marriage, great kids. But beneath the façade of their supposed ideal life, a storm is brewing – as Theo’s career nosedives while Ivy’s own ambitions take off, a tinderbox of fierce competition and hidden resentment ignites. \\n\\nA reimagining of the 1989 classic film The War of the Roses, based on the novel by Warren Adler.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/17bd990283179dee41e379ca8393db38.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"The Roses\",\"synopsis\":\"Life seems easy for picture-perfect couple Ivy (Olivia Colman) and Theo (Benedict Cumberbatch): successful careers, a loving marriage, great kids. But beneath the façade of their supposed ideal life, a storm is brewing – as Theo’s career nosedives while Ivy’s own ambitions take off, a tinderbox of fierce competition and hidden resentment ignites. \\n\\nA reimagining of the 1989 classic film The War of the Roses, based on the novel by Warren Adler.\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"Olivia Colman\",\"Benedict Cumberbatch\",\"Andy Samberg\",\"Allison Janney\",\"Kate McKinnon\",\"Belinda Bromilow\",\"Hala Finley\",\"Delaney Quinn\",\"Wells Rappaport\",\"Ollie Robinson\"],\"direction\":[\"Jay Roach\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/17bd990283179dee41e379ca8393db38.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/93/2e/932ee2eaf6bfd5291f11fd2f37a79fec.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/69/fb/69fb9fd8592524828e7307c42eafebac.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ed/58/ed581cf0b02fe668d7129c923f036a50.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ca/6a/ca6a5bb9b2220891c1b2b4a76d0135e2.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/76/e4/76e4d8b27364014aa1a7f63a200d3b29.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/4b/17/4b175dcda10bfa064af0765a2bfb1106.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/e3/35/e335ae6436ed828cbff48bb24452d8da.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/88/f7/88f7e4408f32f1701bb3e313dc59d51e.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/3a/e1/3ae1764d9953b8eb024039485d564774.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c0/f3/c0f347636af77942946969d5282de5ac.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/17bd990283179dee41e379ca8393db38.jpg\",\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/bb10574632db65a5840160e30e2841f4.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-08-29T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"very strong language, strong sex references, threat, drug misuse\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/359558_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/359558_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Walt Disney\"}},{\"id\":\"290564\",\"title\":\"The Running Man\",\"runtime\":8040,\"genres\":\"Science fiction, Thriller, Action\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"360609\",\"383219\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/039f248880736d836999f3a0ac764085.jpg\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/da/ca/daca4e29e8515fc968a579b9edfaa212.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/73/45/7345c6e6e056edf2730b5c7df25dccf2.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/eb/a7/eba707fae7c214e148e76dcc1f496312.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/38/e0/38e060f4730ae24ca94ee52e8d5d506e.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/be/fe/befe089f135d160fa7d1d556ce8e5a9f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/15/a4/15a48f7c2ae1c9af2d0d2b424b392e11.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/6c/88/6c88f63b7bf6c837c0e955a213b481a9.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/9d/b5/9db5554b571ef7e8ca12ddd799e23c3b.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/33/82/33821a53a25eccee14b16f4401ac297e.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/f4/fd/f4fd56a53c4ae0ba2171d443230fa1cf.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"quadImages\":[\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/6f/8e/6f8e0d1f836e7ee569c509b8e634045c.jpg\"],\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Glen\",\"lastName\":\"Powell\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Josh\",\"lastName\":\"Brolin\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"William H.\",\"lastName\":\"Macy\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Emilia\",\"lastName\":\"Jones\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Michael\",\"lastName\":\"Cera\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Daniel\",\"lastName\":\"Ezra\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jayme\",\"lastName\":\"Lawson\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Lee\",\"lastName\":\"Pace\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Colman\",\"lastName\":\"Domingo\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"David\",\"lastName\":\"Zayas\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Edgar\",\"lastName\":\"Wright\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-11-12T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13760\",\"name\":\"Paramount Pictures UK\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"strong bloody violence, language, brief sex references\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"15\"},\"localRatings\":[]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"The Running Man\",\"synopsis\":\"In a near-future society, The Running Man is the top-rated show on television—a deadly competition where contestants, known as Runners, must survive 30 days while being hunted by professional assassins, with every move broadcast to a bloodthirsty public and each day bringing a greater cash reward. Desperate to save his sick daughter, working-class Ben Richards (Glen Powell) is convinced by the show’s charming but ruthless producer, Dan Killian (Josh Brolin), to enter the game as a last resort. But Ben’s defiance, instincts, and grit turn him into an unexpected fan favorite—and a threat to the entire system. As ratings skyrocket, so does the danger, and Ben must outwit not just the Hunters, but a nation addicted to watching him fall.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/360609_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/360609_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/97/61/97611d56feb7f5e74a99317018493ecb.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/b9ec5b60cc3770a2ddc210a036d0a117.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/039f248880736d836999f3a0ac764085.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\" In a near-future society, The Running Man is the top-rated show on television—a deadly competition where contestants, known as Runners, must survive 30 days while being hunted by professional assassins, with every move broadcast to a bloodthirsty public and each day bringing a greater cash reward. Desperate to save his sick daughter, working-class Ben Richards (Glen Powell) is convinced by the show’s charming but ruthless producer, Dan Killian (Josh Brolin), to enter the game as a last resort. But Ben’s defiance, instincts, and grit turn him into an unexpected fan favourite—and a threat to the entire system. As ratings skyrocket, so does the danger, and Ben must outwit not just the Hunters but a nation addicted to watching him fall.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/9715bc6ead70262855a8c8cb5dcb5173.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"The Running Man\",\"synopsis\":\" In a near-future society, The Running Man is the top-rated show on television—a deadly competition where contestants, known as Runners, must survive 30 days while being hunted by professional assassins, with every move broadcast to a bloodthirsty public and each day bringing a greater cash reward. Desperate to save his sick daughter, working-class Ben Richards (Glen Powell) is convinced by the show’s charming but ruthless producer, Dan Killian (Josh Brolin), to enter the game as a last resort. But Ben’s defiance, instincts, and grit turn him into an unexpected fan favourite—and a threat to the entire system. As ratings skyrocket, so does the danger, and Ben must outwit not just the Hunters but a nation addicted to watching him fall.\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"Glen Powell\",\"Josh Brolin\",\"William H. Macy\",\"Emilia Jones\",\"Michael Cera\",\"Daniel Ezra\",\"Jayme Lawson\",\"Lee Pace\",\"Colman Domingo\",\"David Zayas\"],\"direction\":[\"Edgar Wright\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/9715bc6ead70262855a8c8cb5dcb5173.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/da/ca/daca4e29e8515fc968a579b9edfaa212.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/73/45/7345c6e6e056edf2730b5c7df25dccf2.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/eb/a7/eba707fae7c214e148e76dcc1f496312.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/38/e0/38e060f4730ae24ca94ee52e8d5d506e.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/be/fe/befe089f135d160fa7d1d556ce8e5a9f.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/15/a4/15a48f7c2ae1c9af2d0d2b424b392e11.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/6c/88/6c88f63b7bf6c837c0e955a213b481a9.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/9d/b5/9db5554b571ef7e8ca12ddd799e23c3b.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/33/82/33821a53a25eccee14b16f4401ac297e.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/f4/fd/f4fd56a53c4ae0ba2171d443230fa1cf.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/9715bc6ead70262855a8c8cb5dcb5173.jpg\",\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/b9ec5b60cc3770a2ddc210a036d0a117.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-11-12T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"strong bloody violence, language, brief sex references\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/360609_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/360609_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Paramount Pictures UK\"}},{\"id\":\"1000033654\",\"title\":\"The Secret of Me + Live Q&A\",\"runtime\":5640,\"genres\":\"Documentary\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"403734\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/2add7eded07cf7ebcb5279b3a345a9b4.jpg\",\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Grace\",\"lastName\":\"Hughes-Hallett\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jim\",\"lastName\":\"Ambrose\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Cheryl\",\"lastName\":\"Chase\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Tiger\",\"lastName\":\"Devore\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-11-12T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"1000117242\",\"name\":\"Rogan Productions\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"},\"localRatings\":[]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"The Secret of Me + Q&A\",\"synopsis\":\"It’s 1995 in Baton Rouge, Louisiana. During a feminist studies class, college student Kristi opens her textbook to discover something that turns her world upside down. For as long as she can remember, Kristi has felt different- now she knows why. Demanding her medical records, Kristi is finally confronted with the devastating truth: she has been lied to all her life by those she trusted the most. What follows is the unearthing of an extraordinary and disturbing secret that goes far beyond her own life, leading to the discovery of a psychology experiment on a pair of twins – once hailed as a revolutionary success but now revealed to be a terrible lie affecting thousands around the world.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/81/0c/810cb2857dd1668bf605ef3cc1028ed0.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"The Secret of Me + Live Q&A\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/2add7eded07cf7ebcb5279b3a345a9b4.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us at Everyman Glasgow for a special screening of The Secret of Me, followed by an exclusive Q&A with the Director Grace Hughes-Hallett, Producer Flora Stewart, Head of Rogan Scotland and Mark Hedgecoe.\\n\\nIt’s 1995 in Baton Rouge, Louisiana. During a feminist studies class, college student Kristi opens her textbook to discover something that turns her world upside down. For as long as she can remember, Kristi has felt different- now she knows why. Demanding her medical records, Kristi is finally confronted with the devastating truth: she has been lied to all her life by those she trusted the most. What follows is the unearthing of an extraordinary and disturbing secret that goes far beyond her own life, leading to the discovery of a psychology experiment on a pair of twins – once hailed as a revolutionary success but now revealed to be a terrible lie affecting thousands around the world.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"The Secret of Me + Q&A\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us at Everyman Glasgow for a special screening of The Secret of Me, followed by an exclusive Q&A with the Director Grace Hughes-Hallett, Producer Flora Stewart, Head of Rogan Scotland and Mark Hedgecoe.\\n\\nIt’s 1995 in Baton Rouge, Louisiana. During a feminist studies class, college student Kristi opens her textbook to discover something that turns her world upside down. For as long as she can remember, Kristi has felt different- now she knows why. Demanding her medical records, Kristi is finally confronted with the devastating truth: she has been lied to all her life by those she trusted the most. What follows is the unearthing of an extraordinary and disturbing secret that goes far beyond her own life, leading to the discovery of a psychology experiment on a pair of twins – once hailed as a revolutionary success but now revealed to be a terrible lie affecting thousands around the world.\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[\"Jim Ambrose\",\"Cheryl Chase\",\"Tiger Devore\"],\"direction\":[\"Grace Hughes-Hallett\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2025-11-12T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Rogan Productions\"}},{\"id\":\"266792\",\"title\":\"The Shining (45th Anniversary)\",\"runtime\":8580,\"genres\":\"Horror\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"222392\",\"393934\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/374af497676d55b42351f1140771830c.jpg\",\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Stanley\",\"lastName\":\"Kubrick\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jack\",\"lastName\":\"Nicholson\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Shelley\",\"lastName\":\"Duvall\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Danny\",\"lastName\":\"Lloyd\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-12-12T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"13759\",\"name\":\"Warner Bros U.K.\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"strong violence, language\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"15\"},\"localRatings\":[]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"The Shining 45th Anniversary\",\"synopsis\":\"All work and no play makes the caretaker of an isolated resort go way off the deep end, terrorizing his young son and wife. Jack Torrance has come to the elegant, isolated Overlook Hotel as off-season caretaker. Torrance has never been there before - or has he? The answer lies in a ghostly time warp of madness and murder.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/0d/11/0d11f93b172c68e27fe9b7a0b182229d.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"The Shining (45th Anniversary)\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/374af497676d55b42351f1140771830c.jpg\",\"synopsis\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/a2fe373947445f0ad4ed200f3424a2c6.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"The Shining 45th Anniversary\",\"synopsis\":\"All work and no play makes the caretaker of an isolated resort go way off the deep end, terrorizing his young son and wife. Jack Torrance has come to the elegant, isolated Overlook Hotel as off-season caretaker. Torrance has never been there before - or has he? The answer lies in a ghostly time warp of madness and murder.\",\"certificate\":\"15\",\"casting\":[\"Jack Nicholson\",\"Shelley Duvall\",\"Danny Lloyd\"],\"direction\":[\"Stanley Kubrick\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/a2fe373947445f0ad4ed200f3424a2c6.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/a2fe373947445f0ad4ed200f3424a2c6.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-12-12T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"strong violence, language\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Warner Bros U.K.\"}},{\"id\":\"679\",\"title\":\"The Shop Around the Corner\",\"runtime\":5820,\"genres\":\"Comedy, Romance\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"11344\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/62095667fa5f94e5bb44691f86108db7.jpg\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/81/81/19969774.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/81/81/19969773.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/36/21/31/19242411.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/36/21/31/19501484.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/36/21/31/19501483.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/36/21/31/18462223.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Ernst\",\"lastName\":\"Lubitsch\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Margaret\",\"lastName\":\"Sullavan\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"James\",\"lastName\":\"Stewart\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Frank\",\"lastName\":\"Morgan\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Joseph\",\"lastName\":\"Schildkraut\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Sara\",\"lastName\":\"Haden\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Felix\",\"lastName\":\"Bressart\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"William\",\"lastName\":\"Tracy\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Inez\",\"lastName\":\"Courtney\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Charles\",\"lastName\":\"Halton\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Charles\",\"lastName\":\"Smith\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2021-12-03T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"9597\",\"name\":\"BFI Distribution\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"Contains no material likely to offend or harm\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"U\"},\"localRatings\":[]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"The Shop Around the Corner\",\"synopsis\":\"Bitter-sweet comedy about a group of very human, middle-class Budapest store people.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/4c/81/4c819dde188dab3bac7e82d9704dbd65.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/62095667fa5f94e5bb44691f86108db7.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Alfred Kralik (James Stewart) and Klara Novak (Margaret Sullavan) are employees at Matuschek and Company, a general store in Budapest. Klara and Alfred are constantly at odds with each other, butting heads and disagreeing on almost everything. Both are enamoured of their respective pen pals, who serve as welcome distractions in their lives. Little do they know, they are each other's pen pal and, despite outward differences, have unwittingly fallen in love through their letters.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/b816255d97dfabcb7f8f40a483405ad6.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"The Shop Around the Corner\",\"synopsis\":\"Alfred Kralik (James Stewart) and Klara Novak (Margaret Sullavan) are employees at Matuschek and Company, a general store in Budapest. Klara and Alfred are constantly at odds with each other, butting heads and disagreeing on almost everything. Both are enamoured of their respective pen pals, who serve as welcome distractions in their lives. Little do they know, they are each other's pen pal and, despite outward differences, have unwittingly fallen in love through their letters.\",\"certificate\":\"U\",\"casting\":[\"Margaret Sullavan\",\"James Stewart\",\"Frank Morgan\",\"Joseph Schildkraut\",\"Sara Haden\",\"Felix Bressart\",\"William Tracy\",\"Inez Courtney\",\"Charles Halton\",\"Charles Smith\"],\"direction\":[\"Ernst Lubitsch\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/b816255d97dfabcb7f8f40a483405ad6.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/81/81/19969774.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/81/81/19969773.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/36/21/31/19242411.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/36/21/31/19501484.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/36/21/31/19501483.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/36/21/31/18462223.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"http