xplained death occurs on their own doorstep, their casual sleuthing takes a thrilling turn as they find themselves with a real whodunit on their hands. Directed by Chris Columbus, the film is the latest to be produced through the Netflix and Amblin Entertainment partnership.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/6e/95/6e95600d3d160d917400df5ea206c39e.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/bd/d8/bdd8b41a79d6c32e983a31c18e44a015.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Based on Richard Osman's international bestselling novel of the same name, THE THURSDAY MURDER CLUB follows four irrepressible retirees - Elizabeth (Helen Mirren), Ron (Pierce Brosnan), Ibrahim (Ben Kingsley) and Joyce (Celia Imrie) - who spend their time solving cold case murders for fun. \\n\\nWhen an unexplained death occurs on their own doorstep, their casual sleuthing takes a thrilling turn as they find themselves with a real whodunit on their hands. \\n\\nDirected by Chris Columbus, the film is the latest to be produced through the Netflix and Amblin Entertainment partnership.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/3240c30c06104b6ea126918ef8f0c8f2.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"The Thursday Murder Club\",\"synopsis\":\"Based on Richard Osman's international bestselling novel of the same name, THE THURSDAY MURDER CLUB follows four irrepressible retirees - Elizabeth (Helen Mirren), Ron (Pierce Brosnan), Ibrahim (Ben Kingsley) and Joyce (Celia Imrie) - who spend their time solving cold case murders for fun. \\n\\nWhen an unexplained death occurs on their own doorstep, their casual sleuthing takes a thrilling turn as they find themselves with a real whodunit on their hands. \\n\\nDirected by Chris Columbus, the film is the latest to be produced through the Netflix and Amblin Entertainment partnership.\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[\"Pierce Brosnan\",\"Helen Mirren\",\"Ben Kingsley\",\"Celia Imrie\",\"Richard E. Grant\",\"Tom Ellis\",\"Naomi Ackie\",\"Geoff Bell\",\"Paul Freeman\",\"Sarah Niles\"],\"direction\":[\"Chris Columbus\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/3240c30c06104b6ea126918ef8f0c8f2.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/df/3f/df3ff5acf71d2cd06b2ddc040c7fc6b5.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d2/07/d207d8743fc25a84d92fcf81b5315a0c.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/bd/d8/bdd8b41a79d6c32e983a31c18e44a015.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/43/05/4305d73061f53fe5b905456e734b22cf.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/95/60/95604e7405a7842e67bda80f40cda748.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/28/14/281431ee9f4ba06754a2298b9fc0a90b.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/3d/17/3d1761626f9bfb4c1220df9f2e18124f.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/b6/32/b63243400db4ce336b156b5a71281dfd.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/de/42/de42cb8813c1e57fa537ba949b445153.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/57/09/57090df6961710f3e50f809260a5030f.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/3240c30c06104b6ea126918ef8f0c8f2.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-08-22T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"infrequent strong language, moderate violence, injury detail\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Netflix\"}},{\"id\":\"6787\",\"title\":\"Thelma & Louise\",\"runtime\":7740,\"genres\":\"Comedy drama\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/093ffe9326aacd692224d59bed88040c.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"11179\",\"234740\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://