1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Toddler Club : Arthur Christmas\",\"synopsis\":\"Santa's clumsy son Arthur sets out on a mission with Grandsanta to give out a present they misplaced to a young girl in less than two hours.\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"casting\":[\"James McAvoy\",\"Hugh Laurie\",\"Bill Nighy\"],\"direction\":[\"Barry Cook\",\"Sarah Smith\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{}},{\"id\":\"1000026409\",\"title\":\"Toddler Club: The Bad Guys 2\",\"runtime\":6240,\"genres\":\"Animation, Family, Comedy\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"394944\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/fb768a20ac61c882fdfad61f356f5224.jpg\",\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Pierre\",\"lastName\":\"Perifel\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Sam\",\"lastName\":\"Rockwell\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Marc\",\"lastName\":\"Maron\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":nu