rom ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/3f2ea91e235a88547955b49f7141f7d6.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Toddler Club: The Bad Guys 2\",\"synopsis\":\"The Bad Guys are struggling to find trust and acceptance in their newly minted lives as Good Guys, when they are pulled out of retirement and forced to do 'one last job' by an all-female squad of criminals.\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"certificate\":\"PG\",\"casting\":[\"Sam Rockwell\",\"Marc Maron\",\"Craig Robinson\",\"Anthony Ramos\",\"Awkwafina\"],\"direction\":[\"Pierre Perifel\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/3f2ea91e235a88547955b49f7141f7d6.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/3f2ea91e235a88547955b49f7141f7d6.jpg\",\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/160f2c9ddf18b65581767c3412906f78.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-08-29T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"mild violence, threat, rude humour\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Universal International Pictures\"}},{\"id\":\"1000015252\",\"title\":\"Toddler Club: The Grinch (2018)\",\"runtime\":5100,\"genres\":\"Animation, Comedy, Drama, Family, Fantasy, Musical\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/72e1bc972cfd3d6a76393ed98eb277c3.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"380257\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"releases\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Yarrow\",\"lastName\":\"Cheney\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Scott\",\"lastName\":\"Mosier\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Rashida\",\"lastName\":\"Jones\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Benedict\",\"lastName\":\"Cumberbatch\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Cameron\",\"lastName\":\"Seely\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Pharrell\",\"lastName\":\"Williams\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Tristan\",\"lastName\":\"O’Hare\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Toddler Club: The Grinch (2018)\",\"synopsis\":null,\"poster\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/72e1bc972cfd3d6a76393ed98eb277c3.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"The Grinch and his loyal dog, Max, live a solitary existence inside a cave on Mount Crumpet. His main source of aggravation comes during Christmastime when his neighbours in Whoville celebrate the holidays with a bang. When the Whos decide to make Christmas bigger and brighter, the disgruntled Grinch realises there is one way to gain peace and quiet. With help from Max, the green grump hatches a scheme to pose as Santa Claus, steal Christmas and silence the Whos' holiday cheer once and for all.\\n\\nThis film is showing as part of Toddler Club on Friday and Saturday. Share the fun of the cinema with your pre-schoolers (children aged from 1 to 5), and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake, all included in the price of your ticket\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/1ec1c69905329988c6a7128915ee4aff.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Toddler Club: The Grinch (2018)\",\"synopsis\":\"The Grinch and his loyal dog, Max, live a solitary existence inside a cave on Mount Crumpet. His main source of aggravation comes during Christmastime when his neighbours in Whoville celebrate the holidays with a bang. When the Whos decide to make Christmas bigger and brighter, the disgruntled Grinch realises there is one way to gain peace and quiet. With help from Max, the green grump hatches a scheme to pose as Santa Claus, steal Christmas and silence the Whos' holiday cheer once and for all.\\n\\nThis film is showing as part of Toddler Club on Friday and Saturday. Share the fun of the cinema with your pre-schoolers (children aged from 1 to 5), and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake, all included in the price of your ticket\",\"casting\":[\"Rashida Jones\",\"Benedict Cumberbatch\",\"Cameron Seely\",\"Pharrell Williams\",\"Tristan O’Hare\"],\"direction\":[\"Yarrow Cheney\",\"Scott Mosier\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/1ec1c69905329988c6a7128915ee4aff.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/1ec1c69905329988c6a7128915ee4aff.jpg\"],\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{}},{\"id\":\"1000033702\",\"title\":\"Toddler Club: The Highway Rat + Zog & the Flying Doctors\",\"runtime\":5100,\"genres\":\"Animation, Family, Adventure\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/ba926e6676a970e25d206eea8b468e5b.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"403784\"],\"cast\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"directors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-11-21T00:00:00.000Z\",\"distributors\":[],\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"U\"},\"localRatings\":[]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Toddler Club: The Highway Rat + Zog & the Flying Doctors\",\"synopsis\":\"HIGHWAY RAT is a short animation based on a popular children’s story by Julia Donaldson and illustrated by Axel Scheffler in which a ravenous rat searches for sugary treats to steal.\\nZOG AND THE FLYING DOCTORS is a family animation in which a princess dreams of becoming a doctor.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/61/60/616013c8f07bfb92b537f2e9e5615bd7.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/ba926e6676a970e25d206eea8b468e5b.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us for a Toddler Club double-bill, featuring Julia Donaldson's famous children's tales on the big screen!\\n\\nTHE HIGHWAY RAT\\nThe Highway Rat is a short animation based on a popular children’s story by Julia Donaldson and illustrated by Axel Scheffler in which a ravenous rat searches for sugary treats to steal.\\n\\nZOG AND THE FLYING DOCTORS\\nZog and the Flying Doctors is a family animation in which a princess dreams of becoming a doctor.\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Toddler Club: The Highway Rat + Zog & the Flying Doctors\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us for a Toddler Club double-bill, featuring Julia Donaldson's famous children's tales on the big screen!\\n\\nTHE HIGHWAY RAT\\nThe Highway Rat is a short animation based on a popular children’s story by Julia Donaldson and illustrated by Axel Scheffler in which a ravenous rat searches for sugary treats to steal.\\n\\nZOG AND THE FLYING DOCTORS\\nZog and the Flying Doctors is a family animation in which a princess dreams of becoming a doctor.\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"certificate\":\"U\",\"casting\":[],\"direction\":[],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[],\"release\":\"2025-11-21T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{}},{\"id\":\"323179\",\"title\":\"Toddler Club: The Muppet Christmas Carol\",\"runtime\":5100,\"genres\":\"Comedy, Family\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/ba644ce214486566b6f74356c174bb5c.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"353604\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Brian\",\"lastName\":\"Henson\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Michael\",\"lastName\":\"Cain\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jessica\",\"lastName\":\"Fox\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Dave\",\"lastName\":\"Goelz\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":null,\"distributors\":[],\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"mild scary scenes\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"U\"},\"localRatings\":[]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Toddler Club: The Muppet Christmas Carol\",\"synopsis\":\"Yes, The Muppet Christmas Carol will be back in cinemas this festive season. A gem from the Disney catalogue with some great performances from your favorite Muppets.\",\"poster\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"Toddler Club: The Muppet Christmas Carol\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/ba644ce214486566b6f74356c174bb5c.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"The Muppets perform the classic Dickens holiday tale, with Kermit the Frog playing Bob Cratchit, the put-upon clerk of stingy Ebenezer Scrooge (Michael Caine). Other Muppets -- Miss Piggy, Gonzo, Fozzie Bear and Sam the Eagle -- weave in and out of the story, while Scrooge receives visits from spirits of three Christmases -- past, present and future. They show him the error of his self-serving ways, but the miserable old man seems to be past any hope of redemption and happiness.\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/45e2a1696850490a2ef8cdcf3a0e93b2.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Toddler Club : The Muppet Christmas Carol\",\"synopsis\":\"The Muppets perform the classic Dickens holiday tale, with Kermit the Frog playing Bob Cratchit, the put-upon clerk of stingy Ebenezer Scrooge (Michael Caine). Other Muppets -- Miss Piggy, Gonzo, Fozzie Bear and Sam the Eagle -- weave in and out of the story, while Scrooge receives visits from spirits of three Christmases -- past, present and future. They show him the error of his self-serving ways, but the miserable old man seems to be past any hope of redemption and happiness.\\n\\nJoin us every Friday or Saturday for toddler-friendly cinema screenings. From ages 1 to 5, share your childhood favourites and the best new family film releases with your pre-schoolers, and we’ll bring you a warm drink and a slice of cake or a small popcorn, all included in the price of your ticket.\",\"certificate\":\"U\",\"casting\":[\"Michael Cain\",\"Jessica Fox\",\"Dave Goelz\"],\"direction\":[\"Brian Henson\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/45e2a1696850490a2ef8cdcf3a0e93b2.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/45e2a1696850490a2ef8cdcf3a0e93b2.jpg\"],\"release\":null,\"advisory\":\"mild scary scenes\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{}},{\"id\":\"1000001066\",\"title\":\"Toddler Club: Zog + The Highway Rat\",\"runtime\":3180,\"genres\":\"Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/ba926e6676a970e25d206eea8b468e5b.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"360653\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Max\",\"lastName\":\"Lang\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Daniel\",\"lastName\":\"Snaddon\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Jeroen\",\"lastName\":\"Jaspaert\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Lenny\",\"lastName\":\"Henry\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Tracey\",\"lastName\":\"Ullman\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Rocco\",\"lastName\":\"Wright\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"David\",\"lastName\":\"Tennant\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Rob\",\"lastName\":\"Brydon\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Frances\",\"lastName\":\"de la Tour\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2024-05-17T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"1000098662\",\"name\":\"Magic Light Pictures\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"no material likely to offend or harm\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"U\"},\"localRatings\":[]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Toddler Club: Zog + The Highway Rat\",\"synopsis\":null,\"poster\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/ba926e6676a970e25d206eea8b468e5b.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us for a Toddler Club double-bill, featuring Julia Donaldson's famous children's tales on the big screen!\\n\\nZog (2018)\\nA keen but accident-prone dragon learns how to become a dragon at Dragon School.\\n\\nThe Highway Rat (2017)\\nA greedy rat travels the highway in search of other animals' food.\\n\\nThese short tv-films are showing as part of Toddler Club - the perfect place to introduce your future film lover (aged 1-5) to the magic of the movies! A hot drink and a slice of cake or small popcorn is also included in the ticket price.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/4df5a9d94d5e1233832037702078fe64.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Toddler Club: Zog + The Highway Rat\",\"synopsis\":\"Join us for a Toddler Club double-bill, featuring Julia Donaldson's famous children's tales on the big screen!\\n\\nZog (2018)\\nA keen but accident-prone dragon learns how to become a dragon at Dragon School.\\n\\nThe Highway Rat (2017)\\nA greedy rat travels the highway in search of other animals' food.\\n\\nThese short tv-films are showing as part of Toddler Club - the perfect place to introduce your future film lover (aged 1-5) to the magic of the movies! A hot drink and a slice of cake or small popcorn is also included in the ticket price.\",\"certificate\":\"U\",\"casting\":[\"Lenny Henry\",\"Tracey Ullman\",\"Rocco Wright\",\"David Tennant\",\"Rob Brydon\",\"Frances de la Tour\"],\"direction\":[\"Max Lang\",\"Daniel Snaddon\",\"Jeroen Jaspaert\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/4df5a9d94d5e1233832037702078fe64.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/4df5a9d94d5e1233832037702078fe64.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2024-05-17T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"no material likely to offend or harm\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Magic Light Pictures\"}},{\"id\":\"291744\",\"title\":\"Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery\",\"runtime\":8640,\"genres\":\"Detective, Comedy\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"364433\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/17c255ce6b5a084e1e2c37468ce1b0f9.jpg\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a6/70/a6703cf336c75063dac9333f249d0fc8.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/83/8d/838d1ea9440c9e5bdbc4c56b33fbedd5.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ac/ca/acca7b3c43ca541edf27089c933dac44.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/b6/99/b6990f32658946d11e0840bcf2922ece.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/9a/e4/9ae43b79840de3379780b203ec5fa92e.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d5/a4/d5a44b5e3fa790651c3af0c93ef38cd0.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Rian\",\"lastName\":\"Johnson\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Daniel\",\"lastName\":\"Craig\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Josh\",\"lastName\":\"O'Connor\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Cailee\",\"lastName\":\"Spaeny\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Andrew\",\"lastName\":\"Scott\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Glenn\",\"lastName\":\"Close\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Kerry\",\"lastName\":\"Washington\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Mila\",\"lastName\":\"Kunis\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jeremy\",\"lastName\":\"Renner\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Josh\",\"lastName\":\"Brolin\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Daryl\",\"lastName\":\"McCormack\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-11-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"40174\",\"name\":\"Netflix\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"moderate injury detail, violence, sex references, threat, strong language\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"},\"localRatings\":[]},{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-11-28T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"1000101511\",\"name\":\"Netflix\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"moderate injury detail, violence, sex references, threat, strong language\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"12A\"},\"localRatings\":[]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery\",\"synopsis\":\"Benoit Blanc (Daniel Craig) returns for his most dangerous case yet in the third and darkest chapter of Rian Johnson’s murder mystery opus. When young priest Jud Duplenticy (Josh O’Connor) is sent to assist charismatic firebrand Monsignor Jefferson Wicks (Josh Brolin), it’s clear that all is not well in the pews. Wicks’s modest-but-devoted flock includes devout church lady Martha Delacroix (Glenn Close), circumspect groundskeeper Samson Holt (Thomas Haden Church), tightly-wound lawyer Vera Draven, Esq. (Kerry Washington), aspiring politician Cy Draven (Daryl McCormack), town doctor Nat Sharp (Jeremy Renner), best-selling author Lee Ross (Andrew Scott), and concert cellist Simone Vivane (Cailee Spaeny). After a sudden and seemingly impossible murder rocks the town, the lack of an obvious suspect prompts local police chief Geraldine Scott (Mila Kunis) to join forces with renowned detective Benoit Blanc to unravel a mystery that defies all logic. Academy Award-nominated filmmaker Rian Johnson writes and directs Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery, and assembles another all-star, award-winning cast.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/28/6d/286d639897552a1c275e7d9bb5c59fcf.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/e3cbb70023c0b503a49e83a226dcad11.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/17c255ce6b5a084e1e2c37468ce1b0f9.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Detective Benoit Blanc sifts through a series of suspects when a monsignor turns up dead.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/bfb71e38585b37568cdc27e04d7cebf6.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery\",\"synopsis\":\"Detective Benoit Blanc sifts through a series of suspects when a monsignor turns up dead.\",\"certificate\":\"12A\",\"casting\":[\"Daniel Craig\",\"Josh O'Connor\",\"Cailee Spaeny\",\"Andrew Scott\",\"Glenn Close\",\"Kerry Washington\",\"Mila Kunis\",\"Jeremy Renner\",\"Josh Brolin\",\"Daryl McCormack\"],\"direction\":[\"Rian Johnson\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/bfb71e38585b37568cdc27e04d7cebf6.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a6/70/a6703cf336c75063dac9333f249d0fc8.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/83/8d/838d1ea9440c9e5bdbc4c56b33fbedd5.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ac/ca/acca7b3c43ca541edf27089c933dac44.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/b6/99/b6990f32658946d11e0840bcf2922ece.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/9a/e4/9ae43b79840de3379780b203ec5fa92e.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/d5/a4/d5a44b5e3fa790651c3af0c93ef38cd0.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/bfb71e38585b37568cdc27e04d7cebf6.jpg\",\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/e3cbb70023c0b503a49e83a226dcad11.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-11-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"moderate injury detail, violence, sex references, threat, strong language\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Netflix\"}},{\"id\":\"4066\",\"title\":\"Who Framed Roger Rabbit\",\"runtime\":6180,\"genres\":\"Comedy, Animation\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"11084\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/97e7268512da438282d363fde389b5dd.jpg\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965145.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965144.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965142.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965141.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965140.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965139.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965138.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965137.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965136.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965135.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Robert\",\"lastName\":\"Zemeckis\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Bob\",\"lastName\":\"Hoskins\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Charles\",\"lastName\":\"Fleischer\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Christopher\",\"lastName\":\"Lloyd\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Kathleen\",\"lastName\":\"Turner\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Amy\",\"lastName\":\"Irving\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Joanna\",\"lastName\":\"Cassidy\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Stubby\",\"lastName\":\"Kaye\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Joel\",\"lastName\":\"Silver\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Wayne\",\"lastName\":\"Allwine\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Richard\",\"lastName\":\"LeParmentier\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"1988-07-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"16219\",\"name\":\"Walt Disney\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"Contains moderate violence, mild language, sex references and innuendo\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"PG\"},\"localRatings\":[]},{\"releasedAt\":\"2026-02-12T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"16219\",\"name\":\"Walt Disney\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"Contains moderate violence, mild language, sex references and innuendo\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"PG\"},\"localRatings\":[]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Who Framed Roger Rabbit\",\"synopsis\":\"When Toontown's owner is found murdered, all fingers point to cartoon superstar Roger Rabbit. With nowhere else to turn—and the sinister, power-hungry Judge Doom hot on his tail—Roger begs the Toon-hating detective Eddie Valiant to find the real evildoer. But the plot thickens as Eddie uncovers scandal after scandal and realizes the very existence of Toontown is at stake!\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/9d/ea/9dea4f135af646883f1ec8c75375cca3.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/97e7268512da438282d363fde389b5dd.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Selected by the Production and Technology Branch, Everyman presents: Who Framed Roger Rabbit\\n\\nDown-on-his-luck private eye Eddie Valiant (Bob Hoskins) gets hired by cartoon producer R.K. Maroon (Alan Tilvern) to investigate an adultery scandal involving Jessica Rabbit (Kathleen Turner), the sultry wife of Maroon's biggest star, Roger Rabbit (Charles Fleischer). But when Marvin Acme (Stubby Kaye), Jessica's alleged paramour and the owner of Toontown, is found murdered, the villainous Judge Doom (Christopher Lloyd) vows to catch and destroy Roger.\\n\\nEddie Valiant (Bob Hoskins) is a private eye in 1930s Los Angeles who gains an unexpected client—Roger Rabbit, a cartoon film star, for Eddie lives in a world where cartoon characters are as real as humans. Director Robert Zemeckis’s witty comedy-mystery is a dazzling mix of live-action and animation that incorporates beloved cartoon characters from Disney and other studios. Nominated for its art direction, cinematography, and sound, it won for its film editing, sound effects editing, and visual effects. Richard Williams also received a Special Achievement Award from the Academy for his animation direction. \\n\\nPresented in 2k, the feature returns to the big screen at Everyman at The Whiteley on Thursday, 12 February.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/f4722a026013815366b0cb620465a47b.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Who Framed Roger Rabbit\",\"synopsis\":\"Selected by the Production and Technology Branch, Everyman presents: Who Framed Roger Rabbit\\n\\nDown-on-his-luck private eye Eddie Valiant (Bob Hoskins) gets hired by cartoon producer R.K. Maroon (Alan Tilvern) to investigate an adultery scandal involving Jessica Rabbit (Kathleen Turner), the sultry wife of Maroon's biggest star, Roger Rabbit (Charles Fleischer). But when Marvin Acme (Stubby Kaye), Jessica's alleged paramour and the owner of Toontown, is found murdered, the villainous Judge Doom (Christopher Lloyd) vows to catch and destroy Roger.\\n\\nEddie Valiant (Bob Hoskins) is a private eye in 1930s Los Angeles who gains an unexpected client—Roger Rabbit, a cartoon film star, for Eddie lives in a world where cartoon characters are as real as humans. Director Robert Zemeckis’s witty comedy-mystery is a dazzling mix of live-action and animation that incorporates beloved cartoon characters from Disney and other studios. Nominated for its art direction, cinematography, and sound, it won for its film editing, sound effects editing, and visual effects. Richard Williams also received a Special Achievement Award from the Academy for his animation direction. \\n\\nPresented in 2k, the feature returns to the big screen at Everyman at The Whiteley on Thursday, 12 February.\",\"certificate\":\"PG\",\"casting\":[\"Bob Hoskins\",\"Charles Fleischer\",\"Christopher Lloyd\",\"Kathleen Turner\",\"Amy Irving\",\"Joanna Cassidy\",\"Stubby Kaye\",\"Joel Silver\",\"Wayne Allwine\",\"Richard LeParmentier\"],\"direction\":[\"Robert Zemeckis\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/f4722a026013815366b0cb620465a47b.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965145.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965144.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965142.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965141.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965140.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965139.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965138.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965137.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965136.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/77/09/19965135.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/f4722a026013815366b0cb620465a47b.jpg\"],\"release\":\"1988-07-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"Contains moderate violence, mild language, sex references and innuendo\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Walt Disney\"}},{\"id\":\"1000031943\",\"title\":\"Wicked & Wicked: For Good (Double Bill)\",\"runtime\":18780,\"genres\":\"Fantasy, Adventure, Musical\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"401831\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"images\":[],\"quadImages\":[],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/27a66c20014da301d60b59d1ea499b91.jpg\",\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Jon M.\",\"lastName\":\"Chu\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Cynthia\",\"lastName\":\"Erivo\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Ariana\",\"lastName\":\"Grande\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jonathan\",\"lastName\":\"Bailey\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-11-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"26962\",\"name\":\"Universal Pictures International\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"PG\"},\"localRatings\":[]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Wicked + Wicked: For Good Double Feature\",\"synopsis\":\"Wicked, the untold story of the witches of Oz, stars Emmy, Grammy and Tony winning powerhouse Cynthia Erivo (Harriet, Broadway's The Color Purple) as Elphaba, a defiant social outcast who has yet to discover her true power, and Grammy-winning, multi-platinum recording artist and global superstar Ariana Grande (Hairspray Live!, Don't Look Up), as Glinda, a popular young woman, gilded by privilege and ambition, who has yet to discover her true heart. As the two women forge an unlikely sisterhood, they will empower each other in ways that neither foresees.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/f1/63/f1632a9ed190cdf8870df1c59db416c4.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/ee226555c336aa2127be553b72cbf572.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"Wicked & Wicked: For Good (Double Bill)\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/27a66c20014da301d60b59d1ea499b91.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Everything is turning green and pink again! It’s the double bill we’ve all been waiting for: Wicked, followed by an early preview of the ultimate final chapter, Wicked: For Good.\\n\\nWicked, the untold story of the witches of Oz, stars Emmy, Grammy and Tony winning powerhouse Cynthia Erivo (Harriet, Broadway’s The Color Purple) as Elphaba, a young woman, misunderstood because of her unusual green skin, who has yet to discover her true power, and Grammy-winning, multi-platinum recording artist and global superstar Ariana Grande as Glinda, a popular young woman, gilded by privilege and ambition, who has yet to discover her true heart.\\n\\nIn Wicked: For Good, now demonised as the Wicked Witch of the West, Elphaba lives in exile in the Ozian forest, while Glinda resides at the palace in Emerald City, revelling in the perks of fame and popularity. As an angry mob rises against the Wicked Witch, she'll need to reunite with Glinda to transform herself, and all of Oz, for good.\\n\\nBetween films, there will be a 20-minute intermission.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[]},\"originalTitle\":\"Wicked + Wicked: For Good Double Feature\",\"synopsis\":\"Everything is turning green and pink again! It’s the double bill we’ve all been waiting for: Wicked, followed by an early preview of the ultimate final chapter, Wicked: For Good.\\n\\nWicked, the untold story of the witches of Oz, stars Emmy, Grammy and Tony winning powerhouse Cynthia Erivo (Harriet, Broadway’s The Color Purple) as Elphaba, a young woman, misunderstood because of her unusual green skin, who has yet to discover her true power, and Grammy-winning, multi-platinum recording artist and global superstar Ariana Grande as Glinda, a popular young woman, gilded by privilege and ambition, who has yet to discover her true heart.\\n\\nIn Wicked: For Good, now demonised as the Wicked Witch of the West, Elphaba lives in exile in the Ozian forest, while Glinda resides at the palace in Emerald City, revelling in the perks of fame and popularity. As an angry mob rises against the Wicked Witch, she'll need to reunite with Glinda to transform herself, and all of Oz, for good.\\n\\nBetween films, there will be a 20-minute intermission.\",\"certificate\":\"PG\",\"casting\":[\"Cynthia Erivo\",\"Ariana Grande\",\"Jonathan Bailey\"],\"direction\":[\"Jon M. Chu\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/ee226555c336aa2127be553b72cbf572.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-11-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":null,\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Universal Pictures International\"}},{\"id\":\"303957\",\"title\":\"Wicked: For Good\",\"runtime\":8280,\"genres\":\"Fantasy, Adventure, Musical, Romance\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"331891\",\"393925\",\"403259\",\"403260\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/a689404b76906ffb3af4425a5273a175.jpg\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/96/c5/96c53d84fba471cefdf77dff0b98e0d1.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/f9/88/f98868abbb563eb6af0e2836407afa3f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a1/df/a1df83bfaa036431eb0aa6c44bd92d73.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c0/62/c062a0ef8386401818721b7c447279bc.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/f5/97/f597a63566126845ab239fc67ed3f4e5.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ed/0f/ed0ffa8db09ff0263d67902b09712c6d.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/84/a2/84a23cbd1b384912fa94854a8f29097a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/39/81/3981f542f23a1ba38ce29113060ecbaa.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/91/b9/91b9200feb97412c6f656e1dae8b1ce3.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/00/b1/00b165ab62c0973ccda219244dca761a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Jon M.\",\"lastName\":\"Chu\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Ariana\",\"lastName\":\"Grande\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Cynthia\",\"lastName\":\"Erivo\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jonathan\",\"lastName\":\"Bailey\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Ethan\",\"lastName\":\"Slater\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Michelle\",\"lastName\":\"Yeoh\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jeff\",\"lastName\":\"Goldblum\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Marissa\",\"lastName\":\"Bode\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Peter\",\"lastName\":\"Dinklage\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Ryan\",\"lastName\":\"Mann\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Adam\",\"lastName\":\"James\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-11-21T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"26962\",\"name\":\"Universal Pictures International\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"rating\":{\"advisory\":\"mild threat, violence, innuendo, language\",\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":\"PG\"},\"localRatings\":[]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Wicked: For Good\",\"synopsis\":\"The final chapter of the untold story of the witches of Oz begins with Elphaba and Glinda estranged and living with the consequences of their choices.\\n\\nElphaba (Cynthia Erivo), now demonized as The Wicked Witch of the West, lives in exile, hidden within the Ozian forest while continuing her fight for the freedom of Oz’s silenced Animals and desperately trying to expose the truth she knows about The Wizard (Jeff Goldblum).\\n\\nGlinda, meanwhile, has become the glamorous symbol of Goodness for all of Oz, living at the palace in Emerald City and reveling in the perks of fame and popularity. Under the instruction of Madame Morrible (Oscar® winner Michelle Yeoh), Glinda is deployed to serve as an effervescent comfort to Oz, reassuring the masses that all is well under the rule of The Wizard.\\n\\nAs Glinda’s stardom expands and she prepares to marry Prince Fiyero (Olivier award winner and Emmy and SAG nominee Jonathan Bailey) in a spectacular Ozian wedding, she is haunted by her separation from Elphaba. She attempts to broker a conciliation between Elphaba and The Wizard, but those efforts will fail, driving Elphaba and Glinda only further apart. The aftershocks will transform Boq (Tony nominee Ethan Slater) and Fiyero forever, and threaten the safety of Elphaba’s sister, Nessarose (Marissa Bode), when a girl from Kansas comes crashing into all their lives.\\n\\nAs an angry mob rises against the Wicked Witch, Glinda and Elphaba will need to come together one final time. With their singular friendship now the fulcrum of their futures, they will need to truly see each other, with honesty and empathy, if they are to change themselves, and all of Oz, for good.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/331891_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/331891_uk_hd.mov\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/f2/16/f216416726635edab5a345176cb1fbc5.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/abc95c1fc87480f06359dee3c436ced4.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/a689404b76906ffb3af4425a5273a175.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Now demonised as the Wicked Witch of the West, Elphaba lives in exile in the Ozian forest, while Glinda resides at the palace in Emerald City, revelling in the perks of fame and popularity. As an angry mob rises against the Wicked Witch, she'll need to reunite with Glinda to transform herself, and all of Oz, for good.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/a73fdd852727b1f4af43afb5da7d232a.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Wicked: For Good\",\"synopsis\":\"Now demonised as the Wicked Witch of the West, Elphaba lives in exile in the Ozian forest, while Glinda resides at the palace in Emerald City, revelling in the perks of fame and popularity. As an angry mob rises against the Wicked Witch, she'll need to reunite with Glinda to transform herself, and all of Oz, for good.\",\"certificate\":\"PG\",\"casting\":[\"Ariana Grande\",\"Cynthia Erivo\",\"Jonathan Bailey\",\"Ethan Slater\",\"Michelle Yeoh\",\"Jeff Goldblum\",\"Marissa Bode\",\"Peter Dinklage\",\"Ryan Mann\",\"Adam James\"],\"direction\":[\"Jon M. Chu\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/a73fdd852727b1f4af43afb5da7d232a.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/96/c5/96c53d84fba471cefdf77dff0b98e0d1.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/f9/88/f98868abbb563eb6af0e2836407afa3f.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/a1/df/a1df83bfaa036431eb0aa6c44bd92d73.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/c0/62/c062a0ef8386401818721b7c447279bc.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/f5/97/f597a63566126845ab239fc67ed3f4e5.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/ed/0f/ed0ffa8db09ff0263d67902b09712c6d.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/84/a2/84a23cbd1b384912fa94854a8f29097a.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/39/81/3981f542f23a1ba38ce29113060ecbaa.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/91/b9/91b9200feb97412c6f656e1dae8b1ce3.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/00/b1/00b165ab62c0973ccda219244dca761a.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/a73fdd852727b1f4af43afb5da7d232a.jpg\",\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/abc95c1fc87480f06359dee3c436ced4.jpg\"],\"release\":\"2025-11-21T00:00:00.000Z\",\"advisory\":\"mild threat, violence, innuendo, language\",\"trailer\":{\"SD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/331891_uk_high.mp4\",\"HD\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/QuickTime/331891_uk_hd.mov\"},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{\"name\":\"Universal Pictures International\"}},{\"id\":\"25300\",\"title\":\"Yi Yi\",\"runtime\":10380,\"genres\":\"Drama\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/4c013f906e603d8e24f3b81fb958a650.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"27568\"],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"quadImages\":[],\"releases\":[],\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966963.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966962.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966961.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966960.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966959.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966958.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966957.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966956.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966955.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966954.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Edward\",\"lastName\":\"Yang\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Wu\",\"lastName\":\"Nianzhen\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Issey\",\"lastName\":\"Ogata\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Elaine\",\"lastName\":\"Jin\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Kelly\",\"lastName\":\"Lee\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jonathan\",\"lastName\":\"Chang\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Chen\",\"lastName\":\"Xisheng\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Su-yun\",\"lastName\":\"Ko\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Michael\",\"lastName\":\"Tao\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Suzanne Shu-shen\",\"lastName\":\"Hsiao\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"actor\":{\"firstName\":\"Adriene\",\"lastName\":\"Lin\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"},\"originalVoiceActor\":null,\"localizedVoiceActor\":null}]},\"embargoes\":[],\"locale\":{\"title\":\"A One and a Two... (Yi Yi)\",\"synopsis\":\"NJ Jian, his wife Min-Min and their two kids are a typical middle-class family, sharing their Taipei apartment with Min-Min's elderly other.  Now in his mid-forties, NJ is a partner in a computer hardware firm which made big profits but will go bankrupt soon if it doesn't change direction.  NJ warms to the idea of teaming up with Ota, an innovative designer of games software in Japan, and enjoys spending time with the charming and urbane Japanese man.  Things start to go wrong for the Jians on the day that Min-Min's brother A-Di gets married - Min-Min's mother suffers a stroke and falls into a coma, and NJ bumps into Sherry, his first childhood sweetheart, a woman (now married to an American) he hasn't seen for twenty years.  In the following weeks, Min-Min will breakdown and disappear to a religious retreat, her daughter Ting-Ting will get her first rough lessons in love, her son Yang-Yang will get into trouble at school and her brother A-Di will have to deal with a clash between the bride he chose and the woman he spurned.  There will be an ugly murder in the apartment block where the Jians live; a young man will give in to his sense that life is inherently unfair and cruel and commit a crime which will ruin his own life.  NJ will go to Tokyo to negotiate with Ota - but also to secretly meet Sherry and find out if life can really give him a second chance.\",\"poster\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[]}},\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":\"Yi Yi\",\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/4c013f906e603d8e24f3b81fb958a650.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"Selected by the Directors Branch, Everyman presents: Yi Yi.\\n\\nSet in Taiwan, the film follows the lives of the Jian family from the alternating perspectives of the three main family members: father N.J. (Nien-Jen Wu), teenage daughter Ting-Ting (Elaine Jin) and young son Yang-Yang (Issei Ogata). N.J., disgruntled with his current job, attempts to court the favor of a prominent video game company while Ting-Ting and Yang-Yang contend with the various trials of youth, all while caring for N.J.'s mother-in-law, who lies in a coma.\\n\\nWriter-director Edward Yang’s nearly three-hour comedy-drama earned the filmmaker the Best Director Award at the 2000 Cannes Film Festival. Focusing on three generations of one family during a hot Taipei summer, Yi-Yi tells an intimate yet expansive story that finds room to explore a variety of characters, from the father who questions his life after encountering a lost love to the young boy who chooses to photograph the backs of people’s heads. The final feature from the master filmmaker. It is widely considered one of the great films of the new century.  \\n\\nPresented in 4k, the feature returns to the big screen at Everyman The Whiteley on Thursday, 16 October.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/082b3cff58ca88bfee3de60919e4c060.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"originalTitle\":\"Yi Yi\",\"synopsis\":\"Selected by the Directors Branch, Everyman presents: Yi Yi.\\n\\nSet in Taiwan, the film follows the lives of the Jian family from the alternating perspectives of the three main family members: father N.J. (Nien-Jen Wu), teenage daughter Ting-Ting (Elaine Jin) and young son Yang-Yang (Issei Ogata). N.J., disgruntled with his current job, attempts to court the favor of a prominent video game company while Ting-Ting and Yang-Yang contend with the various trials of youth, all while caring for N.J.'s mother-in-law, who lies in a coma.\\n\\nWriter-director Edward Yang’s nearly three-hour comedy-drama earned the filmmaker the Best Director Award at the 2000 Cannes Film Festival. Focusing on three generations of one family during a hot Taipei summer, Yi-Yi tells an intimate yet expansive story that finds room to explore a variety of characters, from the father who questions his life after encountering a lost love to the young boy who chooses to photograph the backs of people’s heads. The final feature from the master filmmaker. It is widely considered one of the great films of the new century.  \\n\\nPresented in 4k, the feature returns to the big screen at Everyman The Whiteley on Thursday, 16 October.\",\"casting\":[\"Wu Nianzhen\",\"Issey Ogata\",\"Elaine Jin\",\"Kelly Lee\",\"Jonathan Chang\",\"Chen Xisheng\",\"Su-yun Ko\",\"Michael Tao\",\"Suzanne Shu-shen Hsiao\",\"Adriene Lin\"],\"direction\":[\"Edward Yang\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/082b3cff58ca88bfee3de60919e4c060.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966963.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966962.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966961.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966960.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966959.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966958.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966957.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966956.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966955.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/medias/nmedia/18/87/78/82/19966954.jpg\"],\"heroImages\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/082b3cff58ca88bfee3de60919e4c060.jpg\"],\"trailer\":{\"SD\":null,\"HD\":null},\"localizations\":[],\"studio\":{}},{\"id\":\"277428\",\"title\":\"Zootropolis 2\",\"runtime\":6480,\"genres\":\"Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy\",\"__typename\":\"Movie\",\"altId\":[\"356969\",\"393926\",\"393927\",\"393928\"],\"quadImages\":[],\"coDirectors\":{\"nodes\":[],\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\"},\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/115461a03694877466600f8a9a9a936e.jpg\",\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/50/91/5091aba659d3f77bdb94aa1fbf6f0fb5.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/4d/5c/4d5cc0ddcfd3cc14476c3ae21240340c.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/8b/e0/8be05ff7cb817954bac3017219200e42.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/2b/4b/2b4be5e8fe733e7994b7fa5350136b5e.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/e2/dd/e2dd469c1159c135412c2b2ba0e35bec.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/fe/9f/fe9ff009d3f8527a04cec20b571c340c.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/5f/61/5f615086c7472f91210312ab3d1743c9.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/0e/87/0e87662276ed6e7691e02b80238cc37b.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/aa/78/aa7894bdb919ce290fdce3fceb894e89.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/4c/fd/4cfd2b8c6e59233216b09b34c589b0b5.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"}],\"directors\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Byron\",\"lastName\":\"Howard\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"person\":{\"firstName\":\"Jared\",\"lastName\":\"Bush\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"cast\":{\"__typename\":\"CreditsPager\",\"nodes\":[{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Ginnifer\",\"lastName\":\"Goodwin\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jason\",\"lastName\":\"Bateman\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Ke Huy\",\"lastName\":\"Quan\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Danny\",\"lastName\":\"Trejo\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jean\",\"lastName\":\"Reno\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Idris\",\"lastName\":\"Elba\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Nate\",\"lastName\":\"Torrence\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Jenny\",\"lastName\":\"Slate\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Fortune\",\"lastName\":\"Feimster\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}},{\"actor\":null,\"__typename\":\"MovieCredit\",\"localizedVoiceActor\":null,\"originalVoiceActor\":{\"firstName\":\"Andy\",\"lastName\":\"Samberg\",\"__typename\":\"Person\"}}]},\"releases\":[{\"releasedAt\":\"2025-11-28T00:00:00.000Z\",\"__typename\":\"Release\",\"rating\":{\"advisory\":null,\"__typename\":\"Rating\",\"certificate\":null},\"distributors\":[{\"id\":\"16219\",\"name\":\"Walt Disney\",\"__typename\":\"Company\"}],\"localRatings\":[]}],\"embargoes\":[],\"exhibitor\":{\"title\":null,\"poster\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/115461a03694877466600f8a9a9a936e.jpg\",\"synopsis\":\"In Walt Disney Animation Studios’ “Zootropolis 2,” detectives Judy Hopps (Ginnifer Goodwin) and Nick Wilde (Jason Bateman) find themselves on the twisting trail of a mysterious reptile who arrives in Zootropolis and turns the mammal metropolis upside down. To crack the case, Judy and Nick must go undercover to unexpected new parts of town, where their growing partnership is tested like never before.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalizedOverride\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_STILL\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/6c3a1e9838c7b814bad3d27ccf12932f.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]},\"locale\":{\"title\":\"Zootropolis 2\",\"synopsis\":\"In Walt Disney Animation Studios’ “Zootropolis 2,” detectives Judy Hopps (voiced by Ginnifer Goodwin) and Nick Wilde (voiced by Jason Bateman) find themselves on the twisting trail of a mysterious reptile who arrives in Zootropolis and turns the mammal metropolis upside down. To crack the case, Judy and Nick must go undercover to unexpected new parts of town, where their growing partnership is tested like never before. Oscar® winner Jared Bush (co-director/co-writer “Zootropolis,” director/co-writer “Encanto”) is directing and writing; Yvett Merino (Oscar-winning producer “Encanto”) produces. “Zootropolis 2” hits theaters in November 2025.\",\"__typename\":\"MovieLocalized\",\"sdTrailers\":[{\"url\":\"https://m.boxoffice.media/mp4/356969_uk_high.mp4\",\"__typename\":\"MovieVideo\"}],\"hdTrailers\":[],\"poster\":{\"url\":\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/e8/14/e814f871be1ddfd2bb44a28995dae3bd.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"Image\"},\"cmsAssets\":{\"__typename\":\"CMSAsset\",\"images\":[{\"type\":\"DEFAULT_HERO_IMAGE\",\"url\":\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/2/7c78049f6775184faad761abd5764642.jpg\",\"__typename\":\"BOAppImage\"}]}},\"originalTitle\":\"Zootopia 2\",\"synopsis\":\"In Walt Disney Animation Studios’ “Zootropolis 2,” detectives Judy Hopps (Ginnifer Goodwin) and Nick Wilde (Jason Bateman) find themselves on the twisting trail of a mysterious reptile who arrives in Zootropolis and turns the mammal metropolis upside down. To crack the case, Judy and Nick must go undercover to unexpected new parts of town, where their growing partnership is tested like never before.\",\"certificate\":null,\"casting\":[\"Ginnifer Goodwin\",\"Jason Bateman\",\"Ke Huy Quan\",\"Danny Trejo\",\"Jean Reno\",\"Idris Elba\",\"Nate Torrence\",\"Jenny Slate\",\"Fortune Feimster\",\"Andy Samberg\"],\"direction\":[\"Byron Howard\",\"Jared Bush\"],\"coDirection\":[],\"pictures\":[\"https://cms-assets.webediamovies.pro/production/279/6c3a1e9838c7b814bad3d27ccf12932f.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/50/91/5091aba659d3f77bdb94aa1fbf6f0fb5.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/4d/5c/4d5cc0ddcfd3cc14476c3ae21240340c.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/8b/e0/8be05ff7cb817954bac3017219200e42.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/2b/4b/2b4be5e8fe733e7994b7fa5350136b5e.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/e2/dd/e2dd469c1159c135412c2b2ba0e35bec.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/fe/9f/fe9ff009d3f8527a04cec20b571c340c.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.net/img/5f/61/5f615086c7472f91210312ab3d1743c9.jpg\",\"https://all.web.img.acsta.